<title>UK: BTI sets call warrants on Bangkok SET index.</title>
<headline>BTI sets call warrants on Bangkok SET index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International said it has issued one million American-style call warrants on the Bangkok SET index.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one unit of the index.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    $32.4269		  PREMIUM	13.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     $4.215497		 GEARING	7.69 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   08.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	22.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
